[{"s":0,"a":3.2,"d":3.77,"text":"怎样让 K8s 认识一种新资源？","f":"0d06fd52a3.mp3","h":"0d06fd52a3","r":0},{"s":1,"a":0.6,"d":4.18,"text":"只想写一份 PostgresCluster，声明要什么。","f":"fc5fcb336e.mp3","h":"fc5fcb336e","r":0},{"s":1,"a":5.8,"d":5.02,"text":"剩下的 StatefulSet、Service、备份，都由它创建。","f":"82f5842475.mp3","h":"82f5842475","r":0},{"s":1,"a":11,"d":5.06,"text":"Helm 只管安装，Operator 7×24 持续维护。","f":"718d9c4505.mp3","h":"718d9c4505","r":4},{"s":2,"a":0.6,"d":4.01,"text":"CRD 向 apiserver 注册一种新资源。","f":"5f2987edf4.mp3","h":"5f2987edf4","r":0},{"s":2,"a":5.6,"d":3.62,"text":"apiserver 立刻多出一组 REST 端点。","f":"d1a9f519ce.mp3","h":"d1a9f519ce","r":0},{"s":2,"a":10.4,"d":5.09,"text":"从此可以 kubectl get，也能用 RBAC 管控。","f":"e70f20ca02.mp3","h":"e70f20ca02","r":0},{"s":3,"a":0.6,"d":3.94,"text":"结构化 schema 让 apiserver 替你把关。","f":"c1d9bb64ae.mp3","h":"c1d9bb64ae","r":0},{"s":3,"a":5.2,"d":5.14,"text":"格式、范围、CEL 跨字段规则，不合法直接拒绝。","f":"5a39d3d457.mp3","h":"5a39d3d457","r":4},{"s":3,"a":10.6,"d":4.27,"text":"未定义的字段被裁剪，缺省值自动填充。","f":"a7ff8427c2.mp3","h":"a7ff8427c2","r":0},{"s":4,"a":0.6,"d":4.37,"text":"CRD 只负责存，让它生效的是控制器。","f":"7774fe1f41.mp3","h":"7774fe1f41","r":0},{"s":4,"a":5.2,"d":4.68,"text":"事件进队列去重，Reconcile 对比期望和实际。","f":"b5013626f1.mp3","h":"b5013626f1","r":0},{"s":4,"a":10.6,"d":4.32,"text":"手动改成 5 个副本？它马上又调回 3 个。","f":"aa5e5b6428.mp3","h":"aa5e5b6428","r":4},{"s":4,"a":15.2,"d":2.95,"text":"只看当前状态，这叫水平触发。","f":"317d75c79c.mp3","h":"317d75c79c","r":18},{"s":5,"a":0.6,"d":4.32,"text":"Operator 能力分五级，从安装到自动驾驶。","f":"3f10044b3e.mp3","h":"3f10044b3e","r":0},{"s":5,"a":5.6,"d":4.56,"text":"只会安装的和 Helm 差不多，数据库至少要到三级。","f":"5ee3d3fde4.mp3","h":"5ee3d3fde4","r":12},{"s":5,"a":10.4,"d":4.78,"text":"cert-manager、Rook、GPU Operator 都是典型。","f":"fcca0421de.mp3","h":"fcca0421de","r":0},{"s":6,"a":0.8,"d":4.15,"text":"小结：Operator 把运维知识写成代码。","f":"dc4250d5d6.mp3","h":"dc4250d5d6","r":0},{"s":6,"a":5.6,"d":2.9,"text":"下一课，生产集群规划。","f":"234dcae22f.mp3","h":"234dcae22f","r":0}]
